    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "healing and transformation feels like such a lie. how am i supposed to \"transform\" into something when the very thing that made me *me* is gone? it’s not just a setback, it's a complete erasure. i feel like i'm just inhabiting a hollow shell. there's no point in \"healing\" a body that's just a constant reminder of everything i lost. it’s just... empty.",
